## Mermaid 时序图

***mermaid ref="api" caption="接口调用时序"
sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户
    participant C as 客户端
    participant S as 服务端
    U->>C: 点击提交
    C->>S: POST /api/submit
    S-->>C: 200 OK
    C-->>U: 显示成功
***mermaid-end

@next-slide
## Mermaid 类图

***mermaid ref="class" caption="解析器类结构"
classDiagram
    class Parser {
        +parse(src) AST
        -build(lines) AST
    }
    class Renderer {
        +render(ast) HTML
    }
    Parser --> Renderer : 输出 AST
***mermaid-end

